==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tails (Enemy)|Tails]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 45.33 seconds<sup>1,360f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring few meatshields and some anti-Angel units like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] with target Angel [[Talents|Talent]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Delivery Cat]], and/or [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Drone Cat]]. Bring something against Rain D., preferably midrange or backline units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], and even [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]].

